{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"input","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF16O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt16V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s21UnicodeDecodingResultO","text":"UnicodeDecodingResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:St","text":"IteratorProtocol","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:St7ElementQa","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol\/Element"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt16V","text":"UInt16","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt16"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An iterator of code units to be decoded. ","type":"text"},{"code":"input","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same iterator instance in repeated calls to this method. Do not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"advance the iterator or any copies of the iterator outside this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"input"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance, representing the next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until it returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Checking that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"buffered data from the input iterator.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the iterator for a given returned ","type":"text"},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or an error.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example decodes the UTF-16 encoded bytes of a string into an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"array of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instances. This is a demonstration only—if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"unicodeScalars","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let str = \"✨Unicode✨\"","print(Array(str.utf16))","\/\/ Prints \"[10024, 85, 110, 105, 99, 111, 100, 101, 10024]\"","","var codeUnitIterator = str.utf16.makeIterator()","var scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = []","var utf16Decoder = UTF16()","Decode: while true {","    switch utf16Decoder.decode(&codeUnitIterator) {","    case .scalarValue(let v): scalars.append(v)","    case .emptyInput: break Decode","    case .error:","        print(\"Decoding error\")","        break Decode","    }","}","print(scalars)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"\\u{2728}\", \"U\", \"n\", \"i\", \"c\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"\\u{2728}\"]\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF16\/decode(_:)-swift.method","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/utf16\/decode(_:)-swift.method"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Starts or continues decoding a UTF-16 sequence.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"extendedModule":"Swift","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"decode(_:)","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introd